2. Why do we need Events?

Imagine a website where nothing responds.

You click...

Nothing.

You type...

Nothing.

You submit...

Nothing.

That would be useless.

Events make websites interactive.

Without events React would only display information.

With events React can:

Open menus
Change colors
Submit forms
Increase counters
Login users
Search products
Add items to cart

Everything interactive uses events.


